      "content": "but it's not like that. there are no \"small ways.\" everything is watched. if i even try to be myself, there are consequences. my family, my whole life would just fall apart. it's not a phase or something i can just talk through with a mentor. it's just... there is no version of my life where i actually get to exist. it's like i'm already dead, just walking around in a body they own. i just want the weight to stop. i want to just... escape the pressure.",
